    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\" columnspacing=\"1.4ex\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>></mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&</mo><mo> </mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&</mo><mo> </mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>For point of intersection of the two curves for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>></mo><mn>1</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/372a8e3f-1bc1-4b19-b957-c8b4b8f5dfab-image.png\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo></math>Required area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math> Area of the shaded region</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub